      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIRESIDE (6) put the writing on the wall with back-to-back seconds before he delivered at the latest appearance, overcoming a back row draw to score by a head at this circuit and distance. Back on the front row, albeit wide, but this looks suitable so can go on with it. SPIRIT OF SPITFIRE NZ (2) is a newcomer to the David Harris yard from NZ. Hasn't raced since July but had a couple of trials in Sydney last month before heading to SA. Draws well and could measure up. BERSAGLIERE (3) draws well and looks close to a win after three straight placings. He is a chance backing up after finishing runner-up at Port Pirie on Wednesday. BROBENAH GIRL (4) gets her best draw since winning here last month and has been close to the placings in each outing since.",
